OL,3,GNEWSA'I could barely stand up straight
OL,4,Awith menopause after cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who went into medically induced
OL,7,Fmenopause immediately after breast
OL,8,Fcancer treatment has described the
OL,9,Fexperience as "horrible".
OL,11,FRachel Bowman from Hove was 46 when she
OL,12,Fbegan treatment for breast cancer four
OL,13,Fyears ago, but the medication put her
OL,14,Finto complex menopause, when symptoms
OL,15,Fhappen abruptly and often more severely
OL,16,Fdue to medical interventions.
OL,18,F"I could barely move. I could barely
OL,19,Fstand up straight. It was terrible,"
OL,20,Fsaid Bowman.
